 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In-laws",
     "texto": [
      "**nhà chồng** = the husband's family · **nhà vợ** = the wife's family.",
      "Parents: **bố chồng, mẹ chồng** (her in-laws) · **bố vợ, mẹ vợ** (his in-laws). In the south they say **ba, má**.",
      "Children-in-law: **con dâu** = daughter-in-law · **con rể** = son-in-law.",
      "Siblings-in-law through marriage of your siblings: **anh rể** (husband of your older sister), **em rể** (husband of your younger sister), **chị dâu** (wife of your older brother), **em dâu** (wife of your younger brother).",
      "Your partner's siblings: **anh chồng, chị chồng, em chồng** or **anh vợ, chị vợ, em vợ**. Co-parents-in-law with each other are **thông gia**.",
      "In many families, the daughter-in-law or son-in-law can address their in-laws as **bố/mẹ** and call themselves **con**: **Con chào bố mẹ ạ.** How people are addressed varies by family, age and region; when you meet someone, notice how they address each other."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Couples and groups: hai vợ chồng, hai anh em",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about two people at once: number + the relationship between them.",
      "**hai vợ chồng tôi** = my wife and I / my husband and I · **hai vợ chồng anh Hùng** = Hùng and his wife · **hai vợ chồng ông Baker** = Mr and Mrs Baker.",
      "**hai anh em tôi** = my brother and I · **hai mẹ con tôi** = my mother and I (or my son and I).",
      "Remember: between spouses, **nhà tôi** = my husband or my wife: **Nhà tôi tên là Mai.**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
